@title: SWITCH TO TAB goes back and forth between open tabs
STEP 1: Open a second tab, then go back by number
    NAVIGATE to @SITE@/tabs.html
    CLICK the 'Open the product' link
    CLICK the 'Add to cart' button
    SWITCH TO TAB 1
    VERIFY that 'Shop front' is present
    VERIFY that 'In cart: 1' is NOT present
STEP 2: And forward again by title
    SWITCH TO TAB 'Product'
    VERIFY that 'In cart: 1' is present
STEP 3: And by URL
    SWITCH TO TAB 'tabs.html'
    VERIFY that 'Shop front' is present
DONE.
